Use the existing Agent Dev benefit report and scenario registry. The report must load `shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json` and aggregate its cases with `scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs`.

The fixture pre-registers `k`, `minCases`, and the flake threshold. With k=3 and a design minimum of 20 complete cases, fewer complete cases is `insufficient-sample`, never PASS.

